    <string name="identity_title">How others see you</string>
    <string name="identity_no_nickname">No nickname set — only the ID is broadcast. You can set one in Settings.</string>
    <string name="identity_text">The ID is all your phone sends: 8 bytes derived from a signing key that never leaves the phone, not tied to you, your account or your device. Every few minutes the phone also broadcasts a signature, so nobody can pose as you by copying the ID. It can be changed in Settings.</string>

